From eddd4490f0aa931f659d8905c0e95d79a3659513 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Easy Buy <122056680+Volttaik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 11:55:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rank discovery feeds and rewrite search with relevance
 ranking
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace chronological feed ordering with a server-authoritative blended
ranking score (capped popularity + engagement rate + freshness decay +
subscription boost + deterministic per-user exploration jitter) across
Explore, the home feed, generic posts, videos and shorts. Add feed
deduplication via a feed_impressions table (24h window, bypassed for owned
or subscribed-creator content, resilient pre-migration), soft creator
diversity per page, and ranked cursors. Rewrite /api/search with exact >
prefix > substring relevance, engagement + freshness signals, all content
types plus albums, and search indexes. Engagement values remain DB
authoritative; the 60s/90% view rule is untouched.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
